WEBVTT

01:33.450 --> 01:35.420
(Adapted from the web novel "Waiting for You in a City")

01:35.491 --> 01:37.920
(Fireworks of My Heart)

01:37.991 --> 01:40.861
(Episode 24)

01:42.991 --> 01:43.861
Feng Bei.

01:43.991 --> 01:45.030
How's Song Yan?

01:45.260 --> 01:46.861
Dr. Xu is already operating on him.

01:57.040 --> 02:00.010
(Operating Tent 1)

02:09.391 --> 02:10.950
What is this rescue dog doing here?

02:11.021 --> 02:12.721
Yes, this is the medical area.

02:12.790 --> 02:13.820
Dogs can't come in here.

02:14.090 --> 02:15.230
Where did it come from?

02:15.290 --> 02:16.030
I know, right?

02:20.560 --> 02:21.400
Xiao Meng.

02:25.500 --> 02:26.500
Xiao Meng.

02:30.571 --> 02:31.741
Xiao Meng.

02:36.551 --> 02:38.720
You're here on a mission too, right?

02:38.981 --> 02:40.350
Thank you.

02:46.620 --> 02:47.620
Xiao Meng.

02:50.630 --> 02:51.801
Let's go find him.

02:53.801 --> 02:54.630
Let's go.

04:43.840 --> 04:46.740
(Yancheng Firefighter)

05:04.261 --> 05:05.061
Gauze.

05:21.280 --> 05:24.181
(Operating Tent 1)

05:45.571 --> 05:47.071
- Doctor. - Doctor, hurry!

05:47.300 --> 05:48.300
Hurry.

05:49.170 --> 05:50.211
What's the situation?

05:50.271 --> 05:51.410
He was just dug out of the rubble.

05:51.941 --> 05:53.240
He was buried there for about 30 hours.

05:53.511 --> 05:54.641
His right leg is broken, but his left leg is fine.

05:54.740 --> 05:55.550
He's still conscious.

05:55.711 --> 05:56.780
He drank some water, but didn't eat anything.

05:57.251 --> 05:58.211
Run a blood test on him.

05:58.280 --> 05:59.121
Get blood bags ready.

05:59.280 --> 06:00.280
Notify the anesthetist for immediate surgery.

06:00.381 --> 06:01.181
- Okay. - Okay.

06:01.280 --> 06:02.050
Let's go. Come with me.

06:02.420 --> 06:03.321
- Let's go. - This way.

06:03.751 --> 06:04.891
- Be careful. - Slowly.

06:05.061 --> 06:06.290
Slowly. Be careful.

06:11.261 --> 06:12.061
Hello.

06:12.331 --> 06:14.061
Can you give this to the firefighter from Shilitai for me?

06:14.201 --> 06:15.170
Okay, I'll go now.

06:15.300 --> 06:16.631
- Thank you. - You're welcome.

06:25.211 --> 06:26.081
I will consciously uphold...

06:26.141 --> 06:27.780
the dignity and sanctity of medicine.

06:28.951 --> 06:31.511
I will give human life the greatest respect.

06:32.581 --> 06:33.720
Equality and benevolence.

06:33.920 --> 06:34.850
Put patients first.

06:35.590 --> 06:36.790
Respect life.

06:37.191 --> 06:38.150
Learn for a lifetime.

06:38.590 --> 06:40.121
Put efforts to shoulder the lofty responsibility...

06:40.191 --> 06:41.391
of improving human health.

06:41.691 --> 06:42.631
Scalpel.

06:48.571 --> 06:49.730
Forceps. Scissors.

07:01.511 --> 07:02.410
You must be hungry.

07:03.410 --> 07:04.550
- Instructor. - Yang Chi.

07:05.350 --> 07:06.751
- Distribute these. - Yes, Instructor.

07:07.350 --> 07:08.990
- Let's eat. - Is Chief out of surgery?

07:09.751 --> 07:10.550
Not yet.

07:11.821 --> 07:12.790
Did someone take note of the time?

07:12.990 --> 07:14.720
No, Yang Chi. It has been almost four hours.

07:17.030 --> 07:18.090
Distribute the food.

07:18.831 --> 07:19.631
Eat up.

07:20.261 --> 07:21.331
You need to take a break.

07:22.331 --> 07:23.530
The more difficult the times,

07:23.831 --> 07:24.931
the more you need to conserve your energy.

07:25.340 --> 07:26.071
Keep it up.

07:26.540 --> 07:27.571
Hurry up and eat.

07:30.371 --> 07:31.441
What are you waiting for?

07:31.571 --> 07:32.480
Hurry up.

07:33.480 --> 07:34.211
Jun Ping.

07:34.610 --> 07:35.311
Hurry up.

07:35.451 --> 07:36.311
Hurry up and eat.

07:37.050 --> 07:38.050
This is an order. Hurry up.

07:45.461 --> 07:47.621
- Come on. - Jun Ping, eat your food.

07:49.290 --> 07:50.261
Come on.

08:00.600 --> 08:01.701
Hurry up and eat.

08:13.521 --> 08:14.850
He can be moved to the observation tent.

09:14.711 --> 09:15.581
Wait.

10:29.951 --> 10:31.020
We can't save him.

10:31.250 --> 10:32.161
He was just brought in.

10:32.291 --> 10:33.520
He didn't make it to the operating table.

10:36.890 --> 10:37.791
Dr. Xu.

10:38.461 --> 10:40.130
Where's the firefighter we saved?

10:41.931 --> 10:43.000
He's in the ward.

11:00.651 --> 11:01.990
(Ward Two)

11:45.191 --> 11:47.431
Squads one and two, clean up the scene carefully.

11:47.500 --> 11:48.301
Watch it.

11:48.431 --> 11:49.531
Slowly.

11:49.870 --> 11:51.270
- Doctor. - Hurry.

11:51.370 --> 11:52.571
- Is anyone else in there? - No.

11:52.640 --> 11:53.600
There's no one here either.

11:53.870 --> 11:55.000
- No one. - No one.

11:55.411 --> 11:56.411
No one here.

11:59.010 --> 12:00.380
The hospital called.

12:00.811 --> 12:02.551
Song Yan is out of danger.

12:02.651 --> 12:03.581
- Really? - That's great.

12:06.750 --> 12:08.250
Is the surgery over? Is he awake?

12:08.620 --> 12:09.791
The surgery was a success.

12:10.191 --> 12:11.291
Song Yan is in the ward now.

12:11.350 --> 12:12.291
He's getting an IV drip.

12:16.031 --> 12:17.360
- Let's go see him now. - No.

12:17.431 --> 12:18.191
Let's go.

12:18.260 --> 12:19.260
The doctor said...

12:19.360 --> 12:20.360
Song Yan needs to rest.

12:21.561 --> 12:22.500
You need to rest too.

12:24.071 --> 12:25.470
Let's pack up.

12:25.541 --> 12:26.840
We'll go see Mr. Song tomorrow!

12:26.901 --> 12:27.740
- Okay! - Okay!

12:30.470 --> 12:31.370
Let's go.

12:31.610 --> 12:32.480
- Let's go. - Go.

12:50.691 --> 12:51.461
Mr. Meng.

12:52.630 --> 12:54.831
The supplies donated by the company are on the way.

12:56.270 --> 12:57.100
Okay.

12:59.100 --> 13:00.000
Anything else?

13:00.901 --> 13:02.640
Ms. Fu called.

13:02.711 --> 13:04.370
She wants us to...

13:07.411 --> 13:08.811
Okay. I got it.

13:11.510 --> 13:12.980
- Yan Chen. - Mr. Xiao.

13:14.551 --> 13:16.151
I'm going to Wangxiang. Want to come?

13:17.421 --> 13:19.220
There are professional rescue and transportation teams.

13:19.461 --> 13:20.421
Why are you going?

13:20.620 --> 13:22.990
I got a batch of infrared visual life detectors.

13:23.061 --> 13:24.490
It just so happens that there's a medium-sized vehicle...

13:24.590 --> 13:25.531
in the supply convoy.

13:25.661 --> 13:26.860
Isn't this a joint rescue?

13:27.100 --> 13:28.301
We have to do our part.

13:28.531 --> 13:29.470
We'll go see Qin Er too.

13:29.730 --> 13:30.571
Are you coming?

13:30.630 --> 13:31.901
If you don't want to go, I'll go on my own.

13:32.441 --> 13:33.340
At this time,

13:33.441 --> 13:34.640
doctors are very busy.

13:35.071 --> 13:35.911
Don't bother her.

13:36.870 --> 13:37.840
Are you really not going?

13:38.510 --> 13:41.081
(Yancheng Emergency Medical Rescue Team)

16:46.630 --> 16:47.701
Are you all right?

16:49.431 --> 16:50.801
Are you all right?

17:05.110 --> 17:06.850
I'm here to change Dr. Xu's dressing.

17:18.461 --> 17:19.330
Goodness.

17:19.701 --> 17:21.560
Which nurse was so immature?

17:21.861 --> 17:23.830
Why are the beds next to each other?

17:51.230 --> 17:53.300
It's not that I don't know.

17:54.201 --> 17:56.470
But both patients need rest.

17:56.631 --> 17:58.901
At a time like this, they need to recuperate.

17:59.540 --> 18:01.240
They can't date.

18:31.730 --> 18:32.841
She's quite pretty.

18:34.470 --> 18:35.540
Your lover?

18:37.711 --> 18:38.770
She's the girl I'm going to marry.

18:41.381 --> 18:42.911
When I become successful,

18:44.151 --> 18:45.310
I'll go back and marry her.

19:06.540 --> 19:08.070
- Eat up. - Eat more.

19:08.770 --> 19:09.740
I'm full.

19:11.570 --> 19:12.510
There's instant noodles.

19:16.711 --> 19:17.580
Da Peng.

19:19.381 --> 19:20.320
Look at Jiang Yi.

19:31.591 --> 19:32.500
Hang in there.

19:33.161 --> 19:33.901
Jiang Yi.

19:37.830 --> 19:38.730
Jiang Yi.

19:40.171 --> 19:41.070
Ms. Li.

19:48.881 --> 19:50.050
Answer the phone.

19:56.451 --> 19:57.421
Who is it?

20:00.461 --> 20:01.290
Hello?

20:06.601 --> 20:07.431
Mom.

20:09.570 --> 20:10.470
Mom.

20:10.730 --> 20:12.671
- Mom. - This is great. I was so scared.

20:12.740 --> 20:14.070
- This is great. - Where are you?

20:14.141 --> 20:15.300
What's going on?

20:16.211 --> 20:17.770
His mom and aunt were found.

20:17.911 --> 20:19.540
They're receiving treatment at a medical center...

20:19.611 --> 20:20.480
in another village.

20:20.540 --> 20:21.480
They're getting better.

20:22.080 --> 20:22.951
That's good.

20:23.181 --> 20:24.780
- You scared me. - Jiang Yi's mom is fine.

20:26.351 --> 20:27.921
Wait for me to finish my mission.

20:28.080 --> 20:29.421
I'll come back to see you right away.

20:30.191 --> 20:31.050
Rest well.

20:32.661 --> 20:34.191
Don't worry. I'm fine here.

20:36.990 --> 20:37.931
Okay.

20:41.230 --> 20:42.161
So?

20:42.330 --> 20:44.000
I told you your mom is very lucky, didn't I?

20:44.070 --> 20:45.570
- Is everything okay? - Yes.

20:45.701 --> 20:47.040
Of course, Jiang Yi!

20:53.211 --> 20:54.111
That's great.

20:57.411 --> 20:58.310
Ms. Li.

20:58.711 --> 20:59.451
Thank you.

21:17.371 --> 21:19.270
Mr. Xiao, thank you so much.

21:19.570 --> 21:21.740
Your help came just in time.

21:22.000 --> 21:22.871
It's what I should do.

21:23.211 --> 21:24.970
When one party is in trouble, everyone should help.

21:26.780 --> 21:27.711
Let me give you a rundown.

21:37.990 --> 21:40.990
(Yancheng Emergency Medical Rescue Team)

21:51.030 --> 21:51.970
This is the place.

21:54.171 --> 21:55.101
The patient is asleep.

21:55.171 --> 21:56.941
Please keep it down as not to disturb her.

21:57.010 --> 21:58.441
Okay, I'll leave after I see her.

21:58.510 --> 21:59.411
- Okay. - Thank you.

23:09.240 --> 23:10.151
Are you okay?

23:10.211 --> 23:11.310
- I'm fine. - Here.

23:12.310 --> 23:13.250
I'll help you.

23:15.621 --> 23:16.351
Thank you.

23:24.290 --> 23:25.530
You're all working so hard.

23:25.891 --> 23:26.800
It's what we should do.

23:26.901 --> 23:27.861
I'll help you carry it.

23:28.431 --> 23:29.470
No, I'll do it.

23:29.570 --> 23:30.871
It's okay. Where to?

23:30.931 --> 23:31.770
I'll help you bring it there.

23:33.240 --> 23:34.141
Over here.

23:34.270 --> 23:35.000
Let's go.

23:52.451 --> 23:53.621
Who put this bottle here?

23:54.621 --> 23:55.560
I don't know.

23:55.691 --> 23:57.161
Maybe a family member put it here...

23:57.230 --> 23:58.431
to keep his hand warm.

24:00.830 --> 24:01.760
Let's go.

24:24.851 --> 24:25.820
Did it burn you?

24:29.490 --> 24:30.230
How about this?

24:32.591 --> 24:33.560
Thank you.

24:36.030 --> 24:36.830
Did you...

24:37.171 --> 24:38.371
sleep well yesterday?

24:41.740 --> 24:42.941
How long has it been since you slept?

24:44.711 --> 24:45.740
I've been busy.

24:46.810 --> 24:47.681
You.

24:49.211 --> 24:50.980
You're good at giving me orders.

24:53.020 --> 24:54.151
Aren't you the same?

24:54.750 --> 24:55.621
At least,

24:55.750 --> 24:57.990
I can find time to rest for half an hour.

24:58.191 --> 24:59.020
What about you?

24:59.391 --> 25:00.490
If you were buried deeper,

25:00.621 --> 25:01.661
you would have died.

25:03.431 --> 25:04.661
Didn't I tell you...

25:04.730 --> 25:05.830
to be careful?

25:07.901 --> 25:09.101
I will next time.

25:12.941 --> 25:13.871
Song Yan.

25:20.580 --> 25:21.540
What's wrong?

25:22.310 --> 25:23.510
Don't tell me you don't recognize me.

25:26.320 --> 25:27.320
Lu Jie.

25:31.151 --> 25:32.020
Yesterday, my soldiers...

25:32.151 --> 25:33.560
went to the nursing home to rescue people.

25:34.391 --> 25:35.621
When they were being rescued,

25:36.230 --> 25:38.131
I saw that it was you.

25:39.431 --> 25:40.601
You're still alive.

25:43.131 --> 25:44.371
I was saved in time.

25:47.441 --> 25:48.970
You're his wife, right?

25:51.341 --> 25:52.911
Hello, I'm Lu Jie.

25:53.080 --> 25:54.980
We were in the same military unit and lived in the same dorm.

25:55.040 --> 25:57.310
I saw your photo at his place.

25:57.550 --> 25:59.181
The selfie with short hair.

26:05.351 --> 26:06.421
This is Dr. Xu.

26:10.990 --> 26:12.631
Hello, I'm Xu Qin.

26:13.401 --> 26:14.201
Dr. Xu.

26:15.661 --> 26:17.300
Get some rest. I'm leaving.

26:17.631 --> 26:18.770
Don't talk too much.

26:27.580 --> 26:28.980
Was I mistaken?

26:30.911 --> 26:31.851
This...

26:33.050 --> 26:34.250
You didn't get married?

26:37.250 --> 26:38.351
Did I...

26:38.790 --> 26:40.361
get too excited just now?

26:40.621 --> 26:42.320
You were too excited just now.

26:46.461 --> 26:47.330
Lu Jie.

26:48.330 --> 26:49.461
It has been a while.

26:52.500 --> 26:53.641
It has.

26:54.240 --> 26:55.970
I didn't expect to see you here.

26:56.540 --> 26:58.211
After what happened to you,

26:58.871 --> 27:00.010
I had been looking for you everywhere,

27:00.211 --> 27:01.580
but I couldn't find you.

27:01.911 --> 27:03.851
Are you avoiding us on purpose?

27:04.151 --> 27:05.911
I just don't get it.

27:06.520 --> 27:08.320
Why did you transfer to the fire department?

27:09.580 --> 27:10.790
It's all in the past.

27:20.830 --> 27:21.730
Nice.

27:22.530 --> 27:23.970
You're a major now.

27:24.871 --> 27:25.931
Last year.

27:26.641 --> 27:27.500
I got promoted last year.

27:35.010 --> 27:36.310
You look good...

27:36.451 --> 27:37.451
(People's Liberation Army)

27:39.310 --> 27:40.550
in this outfit.

27:49.990 --> 27:50.961
Battalion Commander Lu.

27:51.431 --> 27:52.591
We have a new mission.

27:52.661 --> 27:53.730
We are to assemble immediately.

27:55.830 --> 27:57.131
Copy that. I'll be right there.

28:20.820 --> 28:22.161
This is my contact information.

28:22.461 --> 28:24.330
Don't disappear again.

28:25.730 --> 28:26.601
Keep in touch.

28:28.201 --> 28:29.131
Keep in touch.

28:29.330 --> 28:30.300
You must.

28:30.500 --> 28:31.300
Of course.

28:31.570 --> 28:32.500
I'll get going.

28:51.020 --> 28:52.020
Dr. Xu.

28:53.621 --> 28:54.720
Who sent this?

28:54.861 --> 28:55.921
I think it's your brother.

28:56.091 --> 28:56.891
Where is he?

28:57.030 --> 28:57.830
Has he left?

28:57.961 --> 28:59.230
He already came once yesterday.

28:59.290 --> 29:00.931
He went to see you when you were unconscious.

29:01.000 --> 29:01.830
He came again today.

29:02.030 --> 29:03.101
I said I'd call you,

29:03.230 --> 29:04.270
but he said not to bother you...

29:04.330 --> 29:05.570
and told me to give you these.

29:05.770 --> 29:06.941
Then he left.

29:07.540 --> 29:08.500
Okay.

29:08.740 --> 29:09.970
I got it. Thank you.

29:12.611 --> 29:13.881
Carry on. I'm going to make a call.

29:13.941 --> 29:14.681
Okay.

29:22.421 --> 29:24.250
Hey, Yan Chen. Why are you at Wangxiang?

29:26.461 --> 29:27.560
I had something to do.

29:27.820 --> 29:28.560
It was on the way.

29:29.260 --> 29:30.330
You came yesterday?

29:31.730 --> 29:33.260
I was going to leave yesterday,

29:33.461 --> 29:35.701
but Xiao Yi Xiao said to stay and help,

29:35.931 --> 29:36.770
so we didn't leave.

29:36.830 --> 29:37.901
Why are you in such a hurry?

29:38.101 --> 29:39.000
Have you eaten?

29:39.270 --> 29:40.500
Don't worry about me.

29:40.941 --> 29:42.141
There's still a lot to do at the company,

29:42.871 --> 29:43.810
so I left.

29:44.911 --> 29:46.010
When are you coming back?

29:46.510 --> 29:47.441
I don't know.

29:47.510 --> 29:49.441
The wounded are being sent over one after another.

29:51.810 --> 29:52.711
Don't tire yourself out.

29:53.320 --> 29:54.220
I got it.

29:54.780 --> 29:56.280
I'll get busy then.

30:00.891 --> 30:02.591
If you want to see Qin Er,

30:03.131 --> 30:04.290
I can just turn back.

30:07.631 --> 30:08.601
She's busy.

30:10.070 --> 30:11.070
Let's just go back.

30:11.631 --> 30:12.631
Look at you.

30:13.500 --> 30:15.470
You're the one who wanted to come...

30:15.770 --> 30:17.240
and then leave.

30:17.470 --> 30:19.010
Why are you so foolish?

30:19.740 --> 30:21.480
Can't you just do what you want?

30:23.010 --> 30:24.980
All right. I'll shut up.

30:33.091 --> 30:34.520
Thank you, Ms. Nan.

30:34.591 --> 30:35.861
Thank you.

30:37.931 --> 30:38.730
Dr. Xu.

30:38.790 --> 30:40.161
Your brother is so handsome.

30:40.230 --> 30:41.260
Is he married?

30:41.500 --> 30:42.260
Not yet.

30:44.901 --> 30:46.000
Does he have a girlfriend?

30:46.641 --> 30:47.441
No.

30:47.740 --> 30:48.800
He's so handsome, but he's still single.

30:48.871 --> 30:50.310
That's so unfair.

30:51.270 --> 30:52.211
What kind of girls does he like?

30:52.270 --> 30:53.411
Chen Dong Dong.

30:53.510 --> 30:55.211
Won't you reconcile with your boyfriend?

30:55.841 --> 30:56.651
It's not that.

30:56.780 --> 30:58.381
I'm just asking...

30:58.451 --> 31:00.381
about Dr. Xu's brother.

31:04.020 --> 31:04.951
Distribute this...

31:05.891 --> 31:06.861
to everyone.

31:07.060 --> 31:08.161
Dr. Xu, you can keep it.

31:08.220 --> 31:09.260
It's quite expensive.

31:09.621 --> 31:10.661
This is all I need.

31:11.260 --> 31:12.060
All right.

31:12.260 --> 31:13.260
Thank you, Dr. Xu.

31:17.970 --> 31:19.030
You came to see me too.

31:21.901 --> 31:23.270
Why are you all standing there?

31:23.911 --> 31:24.770
Bidding farewell to the corpse?

31:25.211 --> 31:26.240
Sorry.

31:26.810 --> 31:27.580
We were wrong.

31:29.040 --> 31:30.310
The Command Center has issued...

31:30.451 --> 31:31.651
half a day's rest.

31:31.951 --> 31:32.951
If I didn't stop them,

31:33.111 --> 31:34.020
all of them would be here.

31:34.351 --> 31:35.151
That's right.

31:35.550 --> 31:37.050
Song Yan. You know what?

31:37.490 --> 31:38.951
After the surgery,

31:39.191 --> 31:40.290
you've become a bit more handsome.

31:40.790 --> 31:41.591
Get lost.

31:41.790 --> 31:42.990
It's true. Ask Jun Ping if you don't believe me.

31:43.060 --> 31:44.060
Jun Ping never lies.

31:45.060 --> 31:47.000
They say you're a handsome boy.

31:48.000 --> 31:49.300
Keep it down. There are other people here.

31:49.661 --> 31:50.500
By the way, Chief.

31:51.070 --> 31:53.240
We've become famous for saving the baby that day.

31:53.901 --> 31:55.040
Dr. Xu became famous too.

31:56.911 --> 31:58.341
Was the baby's father found?

31:58.941 --> 32:00.240
His father's a soldier.

32:00.341 --> 32:01.381
When the incident happened,

32:01.580 --> 32:02.780
he was also on his mission.

32:04.310 --> 32:06.111
Look. There's a video.

32:06.550 --> 32:07.381
Come on.

32:07.451 --> 32:08.520
I'll help you up.

32:09.020 --> 32:09.820
Slowly.

32:11.550 --> 32:12.351
Be careful.

32:20.760 --> 32:21.901
I'm so sorry.

32:22.461 --> 32:23.530
The child was saved.

32:23.701 --> 32:25.230
It's the luckiest of misfortunes.

32:28.941 --> 32:30.111
You've all worked hard too.

32:30.171 --> 32:31.010
I didn't expect you...

32:31.070 --> 32:32.671
to be so soft after the surgery.

32:32.871 --> 32:33.681
By the way,

32:33.740 --> 32:36.111
when you got hurt, Dr. Xu went down too.

32:38.310 --> 32:39.310
She went down?

32:39.851 --> 32:40.681
What for?

32:41.451 --> 32:42.681
To be with you.

32:42.750 --> 32:43.591
But...

32:43.651 --> 32:45.451
she went to save someone else before you got in the ambulance.

32:45.621 --> 32:46.391
Chief.

32:46.691 --> 32:48.191
It seems like Dr. Xu...

32:48.320 --> 32:49.421
doesn't really love you.

32:49.790 --> 32:51.691
Pi Pi, do you know what true love is?

32:51.861 --> 32:53.030
- That's right. - If Dr. Xu stayed,

32:53.091 --> 32:54.230
Chief wouldn't like her.

32:54.800 --> 32:56.260
But Chief, let me tell you.

32:56.500 --> 32:58.030
Dr. Xu wasn't with you the whole time,

32:58.101 --> 32:59.300
but she shed more tears...

32:59.470 --> 33:00.841
than all of us combined.

33:01.641 --> 33:03.201
- She cried? - She kept crying.

33:03.270 --> 33:04.070
It's true.

33:04.171 --> 33:05.871
I saw tears rolling down her face.

33:05.941 --> 33:08.141
That's right, Chief. I can tell she really likes you.

33:08.810 --> 33:10.310
A doctor and a firefighter.

33:10.611 --> 33:11.480
A perfect match.

33:11.550 --> 33:12.980
A nurse and a firefighter aren't bad either.

33:13.250 --> 33:14.280
I know what you mean.

33:14.851 --> 33:16.020
All right.

33:16.220 --> 33:18.091
It's almost time. What if the nurse kicks us out?

33:18.591 --> 33:19.851
Jun Ping, Yang Chi and I...

33:19.951 --> 33:21.361
will be on standby.

33:21.621 --> 33:23.330
When he gets up later, push him down.

33:23.861 --> 33:25.191
- Don't let him get up. - Got it.

33:26.490 --> 33:28.661
- Be careful. - If he won't listen, beat him up.

33:29.800 --> 33:30.701
Chief, are you hungry?

33:30.770 --> 33:31.631
Put me down.

33:31.830 --> 33:33.300
- Let me lie down. - Dr. Xu...

33:33.441 --> 33:34.641
really cares about you.

33:35.470 --> 33:36.300
Those tears...

33:37.341 --> 33:38.411
That's enough.

33:38.671 --> 33:39.540
Stop bothering me.

33:39.611 --> 33:40.881
Go somewhere else.

33:41.780 --> 33:42.580
- Okay. - All right.

33:43.141 --> 33:44.381
Let Chief get some rest.

33:44.580 --> 33:45.851
- We'll go. - Okay.

33:46.550 --> 33:47.280
I'll get going, Chief.

33:47.351 --> 33:48.580
You said not to do as he says.

33:49.050 --> 33:50.050
We'll watch from the side.

33:53.151 --> 33:55.060
Xiao Meng, you're not staying with Chief?

33:55.461 --> 33:56.490
You're leaving faster than anyone.

33:57.060 --> 33:58.230
Chief, rest well.

34:06.530 --> 34:07.570
Ms. Nan.

34:08.671 --> 34:10.000
- Your phone. - Okay.

34:10.270 --> 34:11.070
I used up some data.

34:11.171 --> 34:12.240
I'll treat you to a meal when we get back.

34:12.310 --> 34:13.580
It's okay. Don't mention it.

34:15.141 --> 34:16.111
I'll let you get back to work.

34:16.211 --> 34:17.080
Okay.

34:17.580 --> 34:18.310
Wait.

34:19.850 --> 34:20.750
This is for you.

34:24.421 --> 34:25.290
You've lost weight.

34:25.350 --> 34:26.620
Have you not been resting well?

34:28.191 --> 34:29.361
You're so concerned about me.

34:30.261 --> 34:31.961
I don't want you to cause me trouble.

34:32.491 --> 34:33.631
You should go.

34:34.261 --> 34:35.230
Thank you, Ms. Nan.

34:35.461 --> 34:36.461
- Take care. - Okay.

34:36.531 --> 34:37.971
- Bye. - Bye.

34:50.750 --> 34:51.580
Why are you here?

34:53.211 --> 34:54.250
Aren't you happy to see me?

34:54.421 --> 34:55.180
I'll get going then.

34:56.890 --> 34:57.821
No, wait.

35:01.560 --> 35:02.461
Come and sit down.

35:10.901 --> 35:11.870
I'm fine. It's just a minor injury.

35:11.930 --> 35:13.100
- Don't move. - I'm fine.

35:19.310 --> 35:20.180
Be careful.

35:23.551 --> 35:24.511
Are you tired?

35:27.350 --> 35:28.350
No.

35:35.761 --> 35:36.790
Is that okay?

35:38.290 --> 35:39.790
This is the last drip for today.

35:40.031 --> 35:41.430
The director said after it's done,

35:41.500 --> 35:42.631
you can come down for a walk,

35:42.730 --> 35:44.330
but not more than half an hour each time.

35:44.471 --> 35:45.500
Thank you.

35:58.450 --> 35:59.511
I'll tell you one more thing.

35:59.651 --> 36:01.580
Just now, everyone was teasing you and Dr. Xu...

36:01.850 --> 36:02.950
for a reason.

36:03.950 --> 36:05.191
When we found you,

36:05.991 --> 36:07.091
she was the first one to jump down.

36:08.861 --> 36:10.261
She said you were her life.

36:11.330 --> 36:12.461
Instructor told her...

36:12.531 --> 36:14.330
that it was dangerous and to leave as soon as possible.

36:14.660 --> 36:15.700
But she didn't listen.

36:15.901 --> 36:17.370
She wanted to be by your side no matter what.

36:18.330 --> 36:19.830
Anyway, all of us could see...

36:20.241 --> 36:21.370
that she cares about you a lot.

36:22.071 --> 36:23.241
As for the rest,

36:23.571 --> 36:24.611
think about it yourself.

36:58.011 --> 37:01.111
(Ward Two)

37:44.421 --> 37:45.221
Dr. Xu.

37:45.491 --> 37:46.620
On-site surgery completed.

37:48.961 --> 37:50.120
Why are you out here?

37:51.290 --> 37:52.230
I came out for some fresh air.

37:59.171 --> 37:59.971
Let's take a walk.

38:00.171 --> 38:01.241
Your body...

38:01.971 --> 38:03.000
Walking for half an hour...

38:03.471 --> 38:04.471
is not a problem.

38:07.140 --> 38:08.241
Let me help you.

38:29.631 --> 38:30.631
Wanxiang...

38:33.131 --> 38:34.471
used to be very beautiful.

38:35.471 --> 38:36.500
Yes.

38:36.640 --> 38:38.770
(Join hands for earthquake relief and rebuild our homes)

38:43.810 --> 38:44.980
In Grade 12,

38:45.450 --> 38:47.020
we came here together...

38:49.980 --> 38:51.151
in the summer after graduation.

38:53.861 --> 38:54.660
Do you remember?

38:59.060 --> 38:59.991
Yes.

39:10.341 --> 39:11.971
But it's like this now.

39:16.611 --> 39:17.850
Things will get better.

39:35.301 --> 39:36.961
When did you join the army?

39:40.941 --> 39:41.941
When I was 19.

39:43.600 --> 39:44.910
People say that...

39:47.741 --> 39:49.140
there are two things...

39:50.611 --> 39:51.680
that attract men.

39:53.511 --> 39:54.721
Cars...

39:56.381 --> 39:57.491
and military uniforms.

40:00.491 --> 40:01.520
You can say that.

40:26.910 --> 40:27.881
I picked it up...

40:28.051 --> 40:29.381
in the fire truck.

40:44.430 --> 40:45.700
Have you been carrying it with you...

40:46.730 --> 40:48.341
all these years?

40:51.171 --> 40:52.171
Yes.

41:22.171 --> 41:23.910
Dr. Xu, get ready to leave.

41:24.941 --> 41:26.171
Got it. I'll be right there.

41:26.310 --> 41:27.511
I'll get going.

41:33.651 --> 41:34.520
Song Yan.

41:35.850 --> 41:36.750
Let's meet up...

41:38.421 --> 41:39.221
when we're back home.

41:43.160 --> 41:43.961
Sure.
